              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi esondela ekamu, wabona ithole nokusina, intukuthelo kaMose yavutha, waphonsa izibhebhe ezandleni zakhe, waziphihliza phansi kwentaba.",
          "type": "text",
