              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha ithole ababelenzile, walishisa ngomlilo, walichoboza, walifafaza phezu kwamanzi, wabaphuzisa abantwana bakwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
